  "worked_solution": "To evaluate the given expression, we use PEMDAS.\n\nNotice that $(-2)^{-3}=\\frac{1}{(-2)^{3}}.$ So, we obtain:\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}64\\times (-2)^{-3} & = \\\\ 64\\times \\frac{1}{(-2)^{3}} & = \\\\ 64\\times \\frac{1}{(-8)} & = \\\\ -\\frac{64}{8} & = \\\\ -(64÷8) & = \\\\ -8\\end{aligned}\n$$",
